## Current decision boundary

This work only preserves state and inventories named workflows. No candidate has been selected for further evaluation. Keep #292 → #301 → #302 → draft #310 held and unmerged. Once selected, freeze exact source, archive and matching named Wasm before any consolidated evaluation; retain complete-operation p50/p90, blocks and tails, apply no 5% floor, and count only exact allocations owned by the measured subsystem.

